WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.112
In a lakehouse workflow, we often save curated results as a table.

00:00:05.112 --> 00:00:10.302
This example creates a monthly sales table from raw sales data.

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:16.622
The important design choice is the output grain: one row per month and product.

00:00:16.622 --> 00:00:23.808
In a real Spark environment, you would also think about table format, location, and refresh process.
